}
```

exos.sol:
```c
void inverse(char *s)
{
    int n = 0;
    while (s[n] != '\0')
        n++;
    for (int i = 0; i < n / 2; i++) {
        char c = s[i];
        s[i] = s[n - 1 - i];
        s[n - 1 - i] = c;
    }
}
```

On échange $s[i]$ et $s[n-1-i]$ pour $i<n/2$.

